<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-hubaud-yap-excitable-segmentation> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Hubaud, Regev, Mahadevan & Pourquié (2017) excitable FitzHugh-Nagumo segmentation clock gated by YAP mechanotransduction (Mus musculus (mouse E9.5-E10.5 presomitic mesoderm LuVeLu Lfng-Venus / Hes7 excitable oscillator))",
        "Hubaud, Regev, Mahadevan & Pourquié (2017) excitable FitzHugh-Nagumo segmentation clock gated by YAP mechanotransduction faithfully reproduces Mus musculus (mouse E9.5-E10.5 presomitic mesoderm LuVeLu Lfng-Venus / Hes7 excitable oscillator) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/hubaud-yap-excitable-segmentation-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/hubaud-yap-excitable-segmentation-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/hubaud-yap-excitable-segmentation-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2016-hubaud-yap-excitable-segmentation.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Mus musculus (mouse E9.5-E10.5 presomitic mesoderm LuVeLu Lfng-Venus / Hes7 excitable oscillator) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 59.7/100, audit 2026-10-19-yap-excitable-segmentation-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2016-hubaud-yap-excitable-segmentation.py> ;
    schema:about "Mus musculus (mouse E9.5-E10.5 presomitic mesoderm LuVeLu Lfng-Venus / Hes7 excitable oscillator)" ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2016-hubaud-yap-excitable-segmentation.py; output: docs/media/yap_excitable_segmentation_comparison.png; organism: Mus musculus (mouse E9.5-E10.5 presomitic mesoderm LuVeLu Lfng-Venus / Hes7 excitable oscillator); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 7c095d87829d9eb530cca2dc7426f599cd35033e84eed2d0aa2832215c1d822c; artifact_sha256: 6b9dd961ed3e3f482347efcc7c61faa7a228c710bfa98b6ac45f327676603c28; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/yap_excitable_segmentation/mouse_psm_somites_specimen.jpg=8b80971796cb29e2..., datasets/yap_excitable_segmentation/scout_manifest.json=852a6ed7852f291d..., datasets/yap_excitable_segmentation/yap_excitable_segmentation_reference.json=4ae2d924d08acaf7...}" ;
    pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0006-3495(61)86902-6>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cell.2017.08.043>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature10137>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature11804> ;
    pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hubaud-yap-excitable-segmentation-code-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hubaud-yap-excitable-segmentation-model-fidelity>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hubaud-yap-excitable-segmentation-morphometric-validation>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hubaud-yap-excitable-segmentation-overall>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hubaud-yap-excitable-segmentation-parameter-expressivity>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hubaud-yap-excitable-segmentation-repro-package>,
